  "details": "While it is fine to have 50 favourited avatarswithout vrc plus it would be nice to be able to create \"subfolders\" for avatars within that limit.\n\nLike instead of having one group of 50. We could have sorted them into subgroups.\n\nexample of names of groups:\n\n- bunny avis\n\n- Cat avis\n\n- humaoind avis\n\nect.\n\nAs someone with DID i have to painstakingly unfavourite and the favourite avatar again just so all avatars used by one of my alters are right next to each other in sorting.\n\nWould be much easier to manage if i could just make a subcategory for each alternative personality. Like a subfolder in which you could have like 5 avatars (so 10 subfolders max)",
